# shadcn/ui Patterns (self-component)

Fork shadcn **open code** into `src/ui/`; public API in `src/components/`. Match shadcn conventions so CLI updates stay predictable.

## File anatomy (every primitive)

1. `'use client'` when Radix/cmdk/state is used
2. `import { cn } from '@/lib/utils'`
3. **CVA** for visual variants (`variant`, `size`) — export `*Variants` for reuse
4. `React.forwardRef` + `displayName`
5. Spread `...props` — never block native/Radix props
6. `className` merged last via `cn(..., className)`
7. `asChild` + `Slot` on interactive primitives when shadcn does

## Styling rules

- Semantic tokens only: `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-input`
- No hardcoded brand colors (`text-blue-600`)
- Animation: `data-[state=open]:animate-in` classes from `tailwindcss-animate`
- Focus: `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring`

## Composition (compound components)

Complex UI = multiple exports, not one mega-props object:

```tsx
// ✅ shadcn style
<Popover><PopoverTrigger /><PopoverContent /></Popover>

// ❌ avoid
<Combobox mode="multi" showSearch showClear size="lg" ... />
```

Pattern blocks (Combobox, DatePicker) compose `ui/` primitives in `components/`.

## Layer split (this repo)

| shadcn `ui/` | self-component |
| --- | --- |
| Radix + Tailwind + CVA | `src/ui/` — same rules, **not exported** |
| App-specific API | `src/components/` — label, error, controlled state, `*Field` |
| Docs examples | `preview/pages/components/` + `preview/components/doc/` |

## Variants

- Primitives: CVA in the same file as the component
- Design system: map `SizeType` / product variants → ui CVA in `*-variants.ts` when file grows
- `defaultVariants` required; export variant type via `VariantProps<typeof xVariants>`

## Adding from registry

```bash
npm run ui:add -- <name>
```

Review diff, keep `@/` aliases, do not export new `ui/` files from `index.ts` without a `components/` wrapper.
